  "id": "miniapp-dice-game",
  "name": "Dice Game",
  "name_zh": "骰子游戏",
  "version": "2.0.0",
  "description": "A focused on-chain dice game for Neo N3 and Neo X mainnet. Pick one face (1-in-6 chance) and stake GAS; a matching roll pays 5.70x after a 5% house edge. On Neo N3 the bet uses a commit/reveal flow: it commits in one transaction and the roll is revealed from a strictly later block's native randomness — so the outcome is unknowable at commit and a loss can never be aborted.",
  "description_zh": "面向 Neo N3 与 Neo X 主网的链上骰子游戏。选择一个点数（1/6 命中率）并下注 GAS；命中后在扣除 5% 庄家抽水后按 5.70 倍赔付。在 Neo N3 上，下注采用「提交/揭晓」流程：先在一笔交易内提交，再由一个严格更晚区块的原生随机数揭晓掷骰——因此结果在提交时无法预知，输的下注绝不会被中止。",
