    "oracle": {
      "enabled": false,
      "description": "No oracle — on Neo N3 the dice roll is drawn on-chain with Neo's native Runtime.GetRandom using a commit/reveal flow: the wager commits in one transaction and the roll is revealed from a strictly later block."
